# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored (*.local).
#
# Needed only for private repositories and to lift the 60 requests/hour
# anonymous cap to 5,000. Classic token: `repo` scope. Fine-grained token:
# read access to Contents on the repositories you want scanned.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the client bundle, so treat any build
# made with this set as containing the token. Leave it unset and paste the
# token into the app's token field if you plan to deploy the build anywhere.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
